---
description: EnzymeExplorer baseline rule (always apply)
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md in the repo root.

Do NOT open, summarize, or modify generated artifacts (especially anything under outputs/ or build/).
If a task asks for results from generated files, ask for the specific small snippet needed instead of scanning directories.

When making changes:
- Keep diffs minimal and targeted.
- Don’t reformat unrelated code.
- Prefer updating docs/help text when CLI behavior changes.

Before suggesting a PR-ready change, ensure checks align with the repo’s CI expectations (black/flake8/pylint/mypy).
